g", "url": "https://aseminfoboard.org/asem_press_releases/chengdu-declaration-on-green-secure-and-efficient-asia-europe-connection/"}, {"title": "The Asia-Europe Meeting (ASEM)", "url": "https://www.mofa.go.jp/policy/economy/asem/2011.html"}, {"title": "MINISTER LUI TUCK YEW TO ATTEND 2ND ASIA-EUROPE MEETING (ASEM) TRANSPORT MINISTERS’ MEETING (TMM) IN CHENGDU, CHINA", "url": "https://www.nas.gov.sg/archivesonline/data/pdfdoc/20111030001.htm"}, {"title": "page23e 000335", "url": "https://www.mofa.go.jp/erp/aec/page23e_000335.html"}, {"title": "when marking the 20th anniversary of lithuania china relations lithuanian foreign vice minister emphasizes bilateral cooperation in transport sector:30330", "url": "https://mfa.lt/en/news/928/when-marking-the-20th-anniversary-of-lithuania-china-relations-lithuanian-foreign-vice-minister-emphasizes-bilateral-cooperation-in-transport-sector:30330"}, {"title": "when marking the 20th anniversary of lithuania china relations lithuanian foreign vice minister emphasizes bilateral cooperation in transport sector:2536", "url": "https://mission-vienna-io.mfa.lt/en/news/19/when-marking-the-20th-anniversary-of-lithuania-china-relations-lithuanian-foreign-vice-minister-emphasizes-bilateral-cooperation-in-transport-sector:2536"}, {"title": "when marking the 20th anniversary of lithuania china relations lithuanian foreign vice minister emphasizes bilateral cooperation in transport sector:30330", "url": "https://www.urm.lt/en/news/928/when-marking-the-20th-anniversary-of-lithuania-china-relations-lithuanian-foreign-vice-minister-emphasizes-bilateral-cooperation-in-transport-sector:30330"}]}, "The search suggests the premise is off: the Chengdu meeting was the **second** ASEM Transport Ministers' Meeting (TMM), not the first. The first was held in Vilnius in 2009.\n\n- **Chengdu (2011):** The Second ASEM Transport Ministers' Meeting was held in Chengdu, China on 25–26 October 2011. Ministers discussed topics under the theme \"Asia-Europe Connect: Green, Secure, Efficient\" and held dialogues with industry. The meeting adopted the Chengdu Declaration on Green, Secure and Efficient Asia-Europe Connection, and the Action Plan was reviewed and approved at the Second ASEM Transport Ministers' Meeting on 26th October 2011.\n- **Vilnius (2009):** The First ASEM Transport Ministers' Meeting took place in Vilnius on 19th – 20th October 2009 under the initiative of Lithuania, where the Vilnius Declaration was adopted.\n- **Later meetings:** The Riga meeting was described as the 3rd Transport Ministers' Meeting, held during Latvia's EU Council Presidency.\n\nIf you need details on the 2009 Vilnius meeting specifically, I can search for those."], "durationSeconds": 16.067112875, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01LMyTmhvvCcSKH9nVU4tzqo", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
